# Check out every text file with LF, independent of core.autocrlf.
#
# rustfmt.toml pins newline_style = "Unix", and migration checksums are
# computed over exact bytes: `include_str!` embeds a SQL fixture verbatim, so a
# CRLF checkout would change a recorded migration checksum on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
